  "answer": "Yes, this feature request has been made before. Vertical or side tabs, like Edge's, are tracked in terminal#835, and similar requests were closed as duplicates of it (for example terminal#10939). It isn't available yet. The Terminal uses the WinUI TabView control, which only supports tabs above the content. The team has said this isn't on their schedule. They would accept a contribution, either vertical tab support in WinUI itself (upstream issue microsoft-ui-xaml#2194) or a forked TabView control. For now, add a thumbs-up and your use case to terminal#835 rather than opening a new issue."
